  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - Under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval would be required and REFUSED for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its combined siting, height and depth results in an unneighbourly, overly dominant, visually intrusive and overbearing form of development that would adversely impact on the residential amenity of nearby occupants in terms of creating a sense of enclosure and negatively impacting sunlight to and outlook from 69 St Mark's Road, contrary to policies D12.3 and D12.4 of the Merton Local Plan (2024) and policy D3 of the London Plan 2021.\r\n"
